From 41206d4a8f033a5f846c5966d43a738444bd8bef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AzediZ <145237384+AzediZ@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 13:50:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 70/91] Incursions: port the incursion manager and sites to
 Revised

The incursion manager, the 11 site layouts, the GM /incursion commands and the
rewardMgr service come over from the old tree.  Differences from the old code:

- site ships use the room's aggro group, so the Sansha logistics repair each
  other through the normal NPC support code and the Vylade Dien assist works
- a hacked Logistics Control Array switches the mothership's remote repairs
  off and sends them to the pilots instead, while it lasts
- warping to a site room lands at the room's beacon, like dungeon rooms
- ships warp off with the normal NPC warp when a site ends
- the migration only adds the incursion tables and wrecks for the Central
  Bastion and the True Power HQ.  Revised already has the client stats
- mission containers (Nation Ore Refinery, Shield Transfer Control Tower,
  Sansha Control Relay) can be loaded as containers.  Spawning one crashed
  the server
